# Data-Pro-Skill v2.0 — Workspace Rules (.clinerules)

## Core Architecture
- **Skill Entrypoint:** `SKILL.md` (Progressive Disclosure: Tier 1 Ordered Steps 0–7, Tier 2 Invisible Agent Loop & Positive Steering, Tier 3 Context Pointers).
- **Domain Vocabulary:** Always use the canonical **Leading Words** defined in `GLOSSARY.md`.
- **Constitutional Governance:** Every statistical claim, qualitative synthesis, and HTML output must comply with Articles 1–8 of `constitution.md`.
- **Multi-Harness Purity:** Never use XML tags in prompts (`SKILL.md`, `agents/*.md`, `references/*.md`). Use pure Markdown and YAML frontmatter only.

## Primary Deliverable Standard (Article 8)
- The primary report output is **self-contained Edward Tufte HTML** (`.dps/outputs/export/final_report.html`), compiled via `scripts/tufte_viz.py` and `scripts/tufte_html.py` with `references/styles/tufte.css`.
- Every generated HTML report must print cleanly to PDF (`Ctrl+P` / `Save as PDF`) with **running headers and footers on every page** via `@page` rules and `<table class="print-frame">` (`<thead>` header-space + `<tfoot>` footer-space) paired with `.print-running-header` and `.print-running-footer`.
